      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate veterinary doctors and team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners overwhelmingly commend Dr. Badri and his veterinary team for their warmth, deep dedication, and honest advice over many years of practice. Many clients describe feeling truly supported during difficult illnesses and stressful diagnoses. Conversely, several dissatisfied reviewers felt the front desk staff lacked empathy or described phone interactions as impatient."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive care for sick pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the tender, loving care shown to dogs and aging cats during complex medical situations, including diabetes management and surgery. Clients appreciate that practitioners treat their animals like family members and take time to minimize stress. A critical reviewer felt that serious health concerns were not handled with appropriate urgency."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reasonable fees with pricing disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous clients appreciate the clinic for offering fair and transparent pricing, smaller bills than expected, and supportive payment plans for pet owners on fixed incomes. However, several unhappy visitors voiced frustration over high treatment costs and unexpected fees, claiming that the clinic seemed more focused on charges than compassionate care."
      }
    }
  ],
